linos: Hey wait!
[signal arg="player_move_to_target"]
[signal arg="player_face_npc"]

linos: I don't think I've seen you around here before.
linos: Welcome to [color=#4F6B45]Atomonia[/color]. I'm Linos.
- Nice to meet you too..
	linos: Likewise! This village is south east of Chemistria.
	linos: So, you're new around here?
- Where am I?
	linos: This village is south east of Chemistria. You're new, right?
- What's going on?
	linos: This is Atomonia, south east of Chemistria. 
	linos: Hmm? Are you ok stranger? You look pale.

linos: Have you been to Atomonia before?
- No, never.
	linos: I thought so.
- I don't think so.
	linos: That explains the confused look.
- I'm not sure.
	linos: Fair enough.

linos: Wait... Where did you came from?
[signal arg="emote:linos:curious"]
linos: That path leads to a cliff...
linos: How could anyone come from there? Unless....
Player: Unless what??
[signal arg="emote:linos:shocked"]
linos: You're an intruder! You must be planning to harm our village!
Player: WHAT!? Wait no...
Player: I don't even know Atomonia or where Chemistria is! Is that even a real place?
linos: What? Of course it is! What kind of question is that?
Player: I don't know where I am or how I got here!
linos: ... You really don't know anything, do you?
Player: Yeah... And I'm scared. I want to go back!
linos: We don't know how you got here. Where are you from?
Player: I'm from Philippines...
linos: Phili... what??
Player: PHILIPPINES! A country on planet Earth.
linos: Earth? Never heard of it. Our planet is called Atherion...
Player: (Ohhh please no...)
linos: I suppose this is going to make things a little complicated.
Player: Yeah. A LOT.
[signal arg="emote:linos:worried"]
linos: But we'll figure something out.
[signal arg="atomon_walk"]
[wait time="2.0"]

Player: Wait....... What is that?
linos: Oh. That's Hydrubbie. A Hydrogen Atomon.
Player: An... Atomon? What is that? And Hydrogen? As in the element?
[signal arg="emote:linos:giggle"]
linos: I keep forgetting you're not from around here.
linos: Atomons are creatures that live all across Atherion. Each is associated with an element.
Player: Like animals?
linos: In a way. But quite different.
Player: So that thing just walks around the village?
linos: It's a stray. It started wandering here some time ago. We just let it stay.
Player: That's actually kind of cute.
linos: You're already getting along with Hydrubbie.
Player: I wouldn't go that far.
linos: You'll probably be seeing a lot more of them.
Player: I still have so many questions about Atomons.
linos: Actually, there's someone in the village who knows quite a lot about them. He's the best person to ask.
Player: Where can I find him?
linos: He should be around Atomonia somewhere. Pay him a visit when you get the chance.
Player: Alright. I guess I could start there.
linos: Good luck.
[signal arg="quest_accept:quest_chain_001_01"]